Z||000009||Bob Englert||02-06-2001||09:14 PM||||You can get a new wiper switch from Advance Auto for about $55.  It is also available from PartsAmerica.com.  It is a GP Sorensen P/N DS170.  It is the switch the turn signal stalk plugs into.  If Advance does not stock it they can usually get it in a day or so.<P>Everyone should understand that the actual stalk has virtually nothing to do with the wiper action.  Replacing the stalk WILL NOT fix any wiper related problems.  Only the Cruise Control switch is actually in the stalk.<P>------------------<BR>Bob<BR>2 - 87 GT's<BR>85 SE 4 cyl||||reg||1
